      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "​\n\n3층에는 비빔밥 솥밥\n\n한우국밥 \n\n그리고 이디야가 있는 푸드코트까지 \n\n가장 식당이 많이 집중되어 있습니다. \n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjE1/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg0NjI1.f6L5OnexjNSrtOBWApNE7zqBfBTAtMzDWUI3egRolJAg.-RXnx3fHk2Eol92JETWpeewjCgLnWqaRqTmaASa8jCgg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF180144.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjE1/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg0NjI1.f6L5OnexjNSrtOBWApNE7zqBfBTAtMzDWUI3egRolJAg.-RXnx3fHk2Eol92JETWpeewjCgLnWqaRqTmaASa8jCgg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF180144.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "​\n\n이곳은 한 매장내에 한식 카페 등이 \n\n같이 있는 푸드코트에요. \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "3. 음료와 간식거리는 2층에서",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNzIg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg4NzI5.CqZWqBK0srRKeD4MasKw4wxNWZfelQBDRsEYBfPdeAAg.uONtPddsCn6_jGCxU-0Tkx9JlevGez2FYTf-1ZTtLTEg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175607.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNzIg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg4NzI5.CqZWqBK0srRKeD4MasKw4wxNWZfelQBDRsEYBfPdeAAg.uONtPddsCn6_jGCxU-0Tkx9JlevGez2FYTf-1ZTtLTEg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175607.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "​\n\n2층에는 다양한 카페가 있는데요. \n\n한 가지 변화라면 편의점 옆에 있던 \n\n백미당이 없어지고 \n\n이번주부터 영주당 부산과자집이 문을 열었어요. \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjg2/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgzNDkz.Vizjb_VAv7XYgaHDcppUhXPsKAfO2EAPLVRtC3yeLCsg.2pNlPrH66pLKerxFu4slFlLzKllGAlR-RsaezLVZGn0g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175615.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjg2/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgzNDkz.Vizjb_VAv7XYgaHDcppUhXPsKAfO2EAPLVRtC3yeLCsg.2pNlPrH66pLKerxFu4slFlLzKllGAlR-RsaezLVZGn0g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175615.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "​\n\n약과 셈베이 과자등\n\n옛날 추억돋는 과자를 파는 곳이에요. \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTM0/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1Njk5.1xMdeyjaDcopQOnnaxBDKdnHF2T-P0XGzvb4bG-5dlQg.jO-1l76WbuchJ9WbvGcXBihK1Oag1pYLfdnMI6DJm-og.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175623.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTM0/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1Njk5.1xMdeyjaDcopQOnnaxBDKdnHF2T-P0XGzvb4bG-5dlQg.jO-1l76WbuchJ9WbvGcXBihK1Oag1pYLfdnMI6DJm-og.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175623.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjY5/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1ODgw.UqgSqx0Yx_Db8nno-RGdcMo0eX7sppCM2otTV4v1A4og.o_m052IsyxbrHXfUERbcOBiYdH3r_0Tu2Bxy7e29YKEg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175628.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjY5/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1ODgw.UqgSqx0Yx_Db8nno-RGdcMo0eX7sppCM2otTV4v1A4og.o_m052IsyxbrHXfUERbcOBiYdH3r_0Tu2Bxy7e29YKEg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175628.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": "​\n\n뻥튀기도 있고요 고구마튀김\n\n대추말린과자 등등\n\n이런 종류의 간식거리를 팔아요. \n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjQy/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg2Njk5.N1E8t22zd9Bpjjpn1ImxDoIQd1f7Mzp1_2tepad3gtsg.HI7-nP6eSgUYr-Bz3NM4s44a8BSCohto-Go5HZ6dic0g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175635.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjQy/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg2Njk5.N1E8t22zd9Bpjjpn1ImxDoIQd1f7Mzp1_2tepad3gtsg.HI7-nP6eSgUYr-Bz3NM4s44a8BSCohto-Go5HZ6dic0g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175635.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "text": "​\n\n유과같은거 좋아하신다면\n\n여기 쇼핑스탑으로 추천\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTQy/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg4ODQ3.VY0gFISgYQweLKEDpNfoDAnuoukt8D862npu5HHVw_Ag.uBw35tWihJjeNfHpjyiA6LtsbZAy548NALaAzCEdracg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175646.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTQy/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg4ODQ3.VY0gFISgYQweLKEDpNfoDAnuoukt8D862npu5HHVw_Ag.uBw35tWihJjeNfHpjyiA6LtsbZAy548NALaAzCEdracg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175646.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "text": "​\n\n전 이런 고구마튀김이 좋더라고요. \n\n그래서 하나 구매\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 27,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNTUg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgyNjk5.la5KvI72pLvRaDHkkrSzt3kPc8FVAatRkV7NzwEGzxEg.BsY1pL1n_UImVW4Tfp8pIxyhXgVplGbsNB3ACIPCrH0g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175656.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNTUg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgyNjk5.la5KvI72pLvRaDHkkrSzt3kPc8FVAatRkV7NzwEGzxEg.BsY1pL1n_UImVW4Tfp8pIxyhXgVplGbsNB3ACIPCrH0g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175656.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 28,
      "text": "​\n\n약과도 낱개로 판매해서 \n\n맛보기로 사기 좋았어요. \n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 29,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNTQg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg3NzAw.hrarlJXuW35ABvfBYJmiGlJgcnPYgbUswH03mw9JUMAg.j7Vv_RCOTmJ775DVYW7Ukh4kPuye0K5Canb69DNfqIgg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175700.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNTQg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg3NzAw.hrarlJXuW35ABvfBYJmiGlJgcnPYgbUswH03mw9JUMAg.j7Vv_RCOTmJ775DVYW7Ukh4kPuye0K5Canb69DNfqIgg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175700.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 30,
      "text": " ",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNzcg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgyNjg5.fYzMvNY5BZm-7xX5OE9FaJZrXh3mUVAHnzFmxN9pqxcg.zrnXvHe6s7Zw8nzAHuAhv-6g-qxTtFTsTPhlwSzifcAg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175730.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfNzcg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgyNjg5.fYzMvNY5BZm-7xX5OE9FaJZrXh3mUVAHnzFmxN9pqxcg.zrnXvHe6s7Zw8nzAHuAhv-6g-qxTtFTsTPhlwSzifcAg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175730.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTIg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgzNzIw.0SZ28ap5eoNQSvyy47r6szPQBG50FpyVUCWARUKMr5Eg.rMNdxkdQ4mKAl4EOXSrjo_JiTbaRipKxLKseCBODV1Ug.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175823.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTIg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgzNzIw.0SZ28ap5eoNQSvyy47r6szPQBG50FpyVUCWARUKMr5Eg.rMNdxkdQ4mKAl4EOXSrjo_JiTbaRipKxLKseCBODV1Ug.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175823.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 31,
      "text": "​\n\n카운터 옆에서는 계란빵을 굽고 있었는데요. \n\n궁금해서\n\n치즈가 들어간 계란빵을 먹어봤는데요. \n\n계란빵과 치즈 조합이 \n\n꽤 괜찮더라고요. \n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 32,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjc2/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1NjU5.RxigqBRQxdeFYvx53oGzZX3pCX7sGWWOGt1MWnNKLLYg.mJDfhkF1kc2Z5EsTJoN8_6meuejBGJHMum_p65XSG-8g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175932.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjc2/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1NjU5.RxigqBRQxdeFYvx53oGzZX3pCX7sGWWOGt1MWnNKLLYg.mJDfhkF1kc2Z5EsTJoN8_6meuejBGJHMum_p65XSG-8g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175932.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 33,
      "text": "​\n\n약간 고급 계란빵 스타일이었어요. \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 34,
      "text": "4.  편의점은 곳곳에 ",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 35,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTA2/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1NDk0.d4FCQuIjhXVtAuGOo6dPkZechzw_VaIiZ6OxKUh8rWAg.WvSiPHqnL5GD6CsYvR3hBc5V7eA3BTbUyHf-tTQpdkYg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175602.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTA2/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg1NDk0.d4FCQuIjhXVtAuGOo6dPkZechzw_VaIiZ6OxKUh8rWAg.WvSiPHqnL5GD6CsYvR3hBc5V7eA3BTbUyHf-tTQpdkYg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175602.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 36,
      "text": "​\n\n편의점은 곳곳에 위치하고 있고요. \n\n그 다음으로 많은 것으로는 비엔씨 빵집같아요. \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 37,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjgz/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg0NjEw.OgODZDWVoJ8ZqPICQC6DvyG5aQrLGWkUs13_EGHIzDQg.r9XQgSlAfjyLGd1OxyyNzE4EOaBjxxYygLJS2iFpFs4g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175444.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMjgz/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg0NjEw.OgODZDWVoJ8ZqPICQC6DvyG5aQrLGWkUs13_EGHIzDQg.r9XQgSlAfjyLGd1OxyyNzE4EOaBjxxYygLJS2iFpFs4g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175444.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 38,
      "text": "​\n\n1층에는 식당과 더불어 아트박스도 있어요. \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 39,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTUx/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg2NTU1.YybqyFMudKG4d8cDeEx2szDj81AmPCeUGqfMSyiFu2kg.DYXdHPcKP8rLC4neuvhNfb-zC2VR053FBWtpe_rR8ggg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175422.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMTUx/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg2NTU1.YybqyFMudKG4d8cDeEx2szDj81AmPCeUGqfMSyiFu2kg.DYXdHPcKP8rLC4neuvhNfb-zC2VR053FBWtpe_rR8ggg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175422.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 40,
      "text": "​\n\n파리바게트는 1층에 \n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 41,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfOSAg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgzNTAy.ltQsU_QV4LxqdZWghnD6KwVVpQkiZpuo2cPdZs6_9xog.F_fEqb3f1i64GmJzNrGsloxM9YQwrjKo_mQsi6DVfoAg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175418.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfOSAg/MDAxNzcwOTc4MzgzNTAy.ltQsU_QV4LxqdZWghnD6KwVVpQkiZpuo2cPdZs6_9xog.F_fEqb3f1i64GmJzNrGsloxM9YQwrjKo_mQsi6DVfoAg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175418.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 42,
      "text": "​\n\n1층에도 여유로운 식당이 있는데요. \n\n새벽집 국밥국수 \n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 43,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfOTMg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg4MDU4.jg7VaN7KgFn1WjpWFGHeG9Atqb-LtJYHxWpunaOIty8g.ZXPZTqDHUvhxDryn8QNhJv62MYJKok8i9QgGI818_Q8g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175404.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfOTMg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg4MDU4.jg7VaN7KgFn1WjpWFGHeG9Atqb-LtJYHxWpunaOIty8g.ZXPZTqDHUvhxDryn8QNhJv62MYJKok8i9QgGI818_Q8g.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175404.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 44,
      "text": "​\n\n낙지볶음전문 개미집 부산역점\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 45,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMSAg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg0ODgx.V2YiqEBLx6ZiMTwiQz_HoeP59K4jKK4pz_YBqT4tlXsg.gX-nuL6yIKQwvsUy7SETey-uOJQl9rpDRZvtALaxdhsg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175357.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAyMTNfMSAg/MDAxNzcwOTc4Mzg0ODgx.V2YiqEBLx6ZiMTwiQz_HoeP59K4jKK4pz_YBqT4tlXsg.gX-nuL6yIKQwvsUy7SETey-uOJQl9rpDRZvtALaxdhsg.JPEG/900%EF%BC%BF20260213%EF%BC%BF175357.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 46,
      "text": "​\n\n채선당 가마솥밥 \n\n양산국밥까지 있고\n\n김밥집도 있어서 라면과 김밥 간단하게 즐길 수 있어요. \n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 47,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
